 figure to remember from this episode? The figure to keep: Decision (2024-09-05): Use an open licence as the default for open data portal datasets | اعتماد ترخيص مفتوح افتراضياً لمجموعات بيانات بوابة البيانات المفتوحة | New datasets on the open data portal will default to an ope And the lesson to keep: knowledge recorded in its moment saves the next team months of rediscovery. Capture what you learned in EnviroAI before the project forgets it. Thank you Dr. Mariam, and thank you for listening. That was EnviroAI Briefing Cast. Until next time.', 'en', '\', 'local-hash-256', '2026-10-08T07:24:07.055Z', NULL),
